    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitiyaunae ŋilowi a asacaradotonu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Besalel kisitiyau ŋipiiryanotin ŋul ŋilowi ŋulupusiyek, ŋulu kipura-areŋak ka ŋulu areŋak, ŋulu ke esacaradoti ŋulu itiyaa anakibois a ŋina Asegan. Apotu ikes kitiyaut ŋilowi ŋulu ka asacaradotonu, aŋuna ka Aron, lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Besalel kitiyau arapet ŋina ewuakinitae egolid, torae ŋina aya ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan torae ŋina amilimilan ŋina adonyuno ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityeku iŋes egolid ŋolobenen kiwuanak narapet ŋina aya ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan narapet ŋina amilimilan ŋina adonyunit ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akidony ejok nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todonyok arapet ŋin ŋaraco ŋaarei ŋuna ikacakina loseketa alocileta a arapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan arokoba ka arapet a ŋin isibusitae a ŋiboro lu a ŋulu etiyaunitere arapet: Egolid, ŋanaŋgae ŋunapusiyek, ŋunakipura-areŋak ka ŋuna areŋak ta ŋuna amilimilak ŋuna adonyuno ejok; lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitemonok Besalel ŋamoru ŋuna areŋak puu ŋuna enyaritae onikis, toenianak loriko ŋulu ke egolid; ecienakinitae namoru ŋun ejok nooi ŋirorwa a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak iŋes ŋamoru ŋun naraco ŋuna aya narapet aloseketa. Toruwor ikes ŋuna etamunitere ŋidwe a Yakob ŋulusapa; lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitiyaunae eboli ŋolo ka atorobu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todonyu Besalel eboli ŋolo ka atorobu ŋolo adonyuno ejok nooi, ŋolo ekwaan edonyuno ejok ka arapet ŋina ewuakinitae egolid, torae ŋolo aya ŋiraŋgi lu: Ŋolopus, ŋolo kipurat-areŋan areŋan ka ŋolo areŋan torae ŋolo amilimilan ŋolo adonyuno ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariyan ŋiwaetin ŋuluomwon ke eboli a ŋol daadaŋ, irotakina ŋarwa ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak iŋes ŋilaino ŋiomwon ŋulu a ŋamoru a ŋuna epol egyelit, elain ŋolo esyaunan ayakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna areŋak puu, ŋuna enyaritae Karinelian ka ŋuna enyaŋiyarito ŋuna enyaritae Topas ta ŋuna alibak nooi ŋuna enyaritae Karisolite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiarei ayakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Yasiper ka ŋunapusiyek ŋuna enyaritae Sapire ta ŋuna alibak nooi ŋuna enyaritae Emerald. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiuni ayakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Jacinis ka ŋuna egogoŋ nooi ŋuna enyaritae Agate ta ŋunapusiyek-areŋak ŋuna enyaritae Amesist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elain ŋolo a ŋiomwon ayakasi ŋamoru nu: Ŋuna enyaŋiyarito ŋuna enyaritae Karisolite ka ŋuna areŋak puu ŋuna enyaritae onikis ta ŋuna inyalal ŋiraŋgi ŋuna enyaritae Yasiper. Aenianakinitae ŋamoru ŋun iwapei isibakitae a ŋiriko a ŋulu etiyaunitae ke egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋamoru ŋun ŋatomon ka ŋaarei, a ŋinamoru egiritae ekiro epei a ŋidwe a Yakob a ŋulusapa; ŋolokiro imarit ekabila epei alotooma ŋikabilae ŋulutomon ka ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau iŋes ke egolid bon ŋiriko ŋulu asonyitae ikwa ŋaunoi, kiwuak loboli ŋolo ka atorobu ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau iŋes ke egolid ŋiriko ŋiarei ka ŋikabobooe ŋiarei, ido toenik locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu ke eboli a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toenik iŋes ŋiriko ŋuluarei ŋul lokabobooe ŋulu alocileta ke eboli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido toenia iŋes epeiwae ŋiriko locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu alokidiama eboli, totapakin naraco ŋuna ka arapet ŋuna aya kidiama ŋiseketa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau iŋes ke egolid ŋikabobooe ŋiarei, toenik locileta ŋuluarei ŋulu alokwap eboli, toenik alokwap alodiyete arapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau nai iŋes a egolid ŋikabobooe ŋice ŋiarei, toenik kwap ŋaraco ŋuna a ŋiseketa neni iryamyata eboli ka neni isibusitae anarapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toenik iŋes ka ausi a ŋinapus ŋikabobooe a eboli lokabobooe a arapet, toenik ausi ŋinapus ŋin narokoba ŋina ka acir; ikotere nyidalidala eboli anarapet, anerae ecikit Ekapolon Moses kitiya ŋun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitiyaunae ŋilowi ŋuluce ŋulu a asacaradotonu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Besalel kitiyau ekaaso ŋolopus ŋolo ani enapyo kidokokino arapet alokidiama, ŋolo adonyunit ituŋanan ŋini eyeni akidony ejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topedok kidiŋ keŋ neni itori akou enapyo, ido totokok nen a ŋiusyo a ŋulu asonyony ejok nooi kiryam; kikwaanikin ka neni etokere abilet ka anaŋga. Arae ŋun ikotere nyecila nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak iŋes neni iwasi alokwap a elou ŋikatelitel ŋulu ekwaan ka ŋaraito ke ekitoe a ŋolo ikwaan ka ekacikicikit. Arae ŋiraŋgi a ŋikatelitel a ŋul ŋulupusiyek, ŋulu kipura-areŋak ka ŋulu areŋak, ido adonyonokinitoe ŋiusyo ŋulu amilimilak kwap ekaaso ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau iŋes ke egolid tari ŋitworoi ŋulu cicik ŋulu ewuakinitae nakidiŋon a ŋikatelitel a ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Besalel nyitutupanak ŋitworoi make, kori ŋikatelitel make aneni iwasi alokwap ke ekaaso a ŋol, a ŋolo etiyaare etic ke Ekapolon, ikwapei ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
